# Python build artifacts (a real, twice-repeated leak in ubx-sdk-aws's own
# history: __pycache__ in the original generation, *.egg-info in its own
# restructure) -- .gitignore added from the start here instead.
#
# dist/ and build/ are anchored to sdk/python/ specifically (UBI-249):
# a bare, unanchored `build/` also matched a real generated package,
# sdk/go/github/data/build/ (the github_build data source), silently
# excluding it from every commit in ubx-sdk-github since that repo's
# creation. Confirmed via a real dispatch of translator-watch.yml,
# which diffs raw generator output against the checked-out tree
# directly, bypassing git and .gitignore -- a git-based comparison
# would never have caught this.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
sdk/python/dist/
sdk/python/build/

# TypeScript/Deno
node_modules/
